  "id": "canonical-delphi-angular-widget-crud",
  "targetStack": "angular-dotnet8",
  "displayName": "Delphi REST resource -> Angular + .NET 8 Web API",
  "description": "Reference Delphi-to-Angular+.NET-8 scaffold for a routine that exposes a list/create/delete resource (the DMVCFramework/mORMot2 style of Delphi REST endpoint). Produces two paired, independently buildable packages: an ASP.NET Core 8 Web API (WidgetRecordPort for data access, WidgetService for business rules, WidgetsController for HTTP) and an Angular 18 standalone-component app (WidgetService calling the API, WidgetListComponent rendering it) with Jest unit tests on both the service and component. This is the first archetype spanning two runtimes/build systems in one package -- CompileValidator builds and tests each half with its own toolchain (dotnet build/test for backend/, npm ci + ng build + jest for frontend/) and reports one combined result.",
